=2 Walkthrough
!Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) Secret Doors.jpg||One of the Secret Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) Doors.
* After talking to the Campaign Ops NPC, speak to {n:Yasmina} (G-5) for details. She will ask you to which stronghold you want to ride:
** {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)} - Time to Beat: ? (__Between 1:09 and 1:41 will be fast enough__)
** {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} - Time to Beat: ? (__5:02 was fast enough, 5:05 **was too slow**.__)
*** In order to progress this option, you must ride the Chocobo through Fivespires to {n:Lamurara, C.C.}. As Magna Cache missions require the nation to hold the stronghold.
*** Since the Phosphorous Ward will not open while mounted, it's required to use the small brick doors that look like Windows, such as the one at F-10.
*** Proceed inside until you reach the middle of Fivespires, and locate {n:Lamurara, C.C.} on the middle raised area/platform. Approaching them will initiate a cut-scene while mounted. **DO NOT** dismount under any circumstance before this cut-scene triggers. Or else the Ops Mission will fail, and no reward will be given.
** {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} - Time to Beat: ? (__8:14 was fast enough, 8:31 **wasn't** fast enough.__)
** {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} - Time to Beat: ? (__10:27 seconds was fast enough, 13:41 **wasn't** fast enough__)
* Ride your Chocobo to the stronghold. When you arrive at the Campaign Arbiter, you will automatically dismount and get a cut-scene.
* Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* Northern Front Strongholds will not contribute to this Campaign Op.

